            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755830/extras/55acdb38a0f1fed21877ab44aa3003f5.poster.avif?t=1605192582\" width=480 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755830/extras/55acdb38a0f1fed21877ab44aa3003f5.webm?t=1605192582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755830/extras/55acdb38a0f1fed21877ab44aa3003f5.mp4?t=1605192582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Lonely Astronaut is a one-button arcade game in which you pilot the corpse of a long-abandoned astronaut floating in a cosmic graveyard. In the process, you might find out something about the human condition. But probably not.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Pilot a Corpse with a Single Button:</strong> With only the ability to thrust the Astronaut's body around with its malfunctioning jetpack, Lonely Astronaut is easy to pick up and <span class=\"bb_strike\">play</span> weep.<br></li><li><strong>Discover Cosmic Truths:</strong> The wonders of space will reveal themselves to you as you play. If only you were alive to see these truths unfold.<br></li><li><strong>Unlock Skulls:</strong> Play dress-up with your corpse because that's healthy, and discover their unique properties.<br></li><li><strong>Feel Existential Dread:</strong> Here's a friendly reminder that you and I are all going to die someday, probably sooner than we'd like to think.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755830/extras/55acdb38a0f1fed21877ab44aa3003f5.poster.avif?t=1605192582\" width=480 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755830/extras/55acdb38a0f1fed21877ab44aa3003f5.webm?t=1605192582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/755830/extras/55acdb38a0f1fed21877ab44aa3003f5.mp4?t=1605192582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Lonely Astronaut is a one-button arcade game in which you pilot the corpse of a long-abandoned astronaut floating in a cosmic graveyard. In the process, you might find out something about the human condition. But probably not.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Pilot a Corpse with a Single Button:</strong> With only the ability to thrust the Astronaut's body around with its malfunctioning jetpack, Lonely Astronaut is easy to pick up and <span class=\"bb_strike\">play</span> weep.<br></li><li><strong>Discover Cosmic Truths:</strong> The wonders of space will reveal themselves to you as you play. If only you were alive to see these truths unfold.<br></li><li><strong>Unlock Skulls:</strong> Play dress-up with your corpse because that's healthy, and discover their unique properties.<br></li><li><strong>Feel Existential Dread:</strong> Here's a friendly reminder that you and I are all going to die someday, probably sooner than we'd like to think.</li></ul>",
